  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－匹克球",
    "sub_ename": "PICKLE BALL",
    "describe_ch": "匹克球是一項結合網球、羽球與桌球，並相當適合初學者的持拍類運動，透過18週的教學課程，學生可完全體驗技術、規則與比賽之學習，並從中得到學習樂趣與足夠的身體活動量。",
    "describe_eh": "Pickle ball is a racket sport that combines tennis, badminton and billiards and is quite suitable for beginners. Through the 18-week teaching program, students can fully experience the learning of technology, rules and competition, and get learning fun and enough physical activity.",
